-- CHANGES FROM v27:
--
--  BUG FIX: Bot jumps over laser 1 but lands on laser 2
--
--  Fix 1 - arcSafe: full physics-accurate trajectory
--    Every point of the jump arc is now checked against
--    ALL laser positions at the matching future timestamp
--    (not just the landing spot). This catches cases
--    where the arc itself clips through a laser mid-flight.
--
--  Fix 2 - Dive mechanic (Space mid-air)
--    In Roblox the dive / fast-fall is triggered by
--    calling hum:ChangeState(Jumping) a second time
--    while already airborne. This cuts the arc short:
--    the character falls straight down from the dive point.
--    The bot now simulates 4 options for every jump:
--      a) Normal full arc
--      b) Dive at 30% of air time
--      c) Dive at 50% of air time
--      d) Dive at 70% of air time
--    It picks the option whose ENTIRE trajectory
--    (including post-dive fall) clears all lasers.
--    Dive is only fired mid-air if a dive was pre-planned.
--
--  Fix 3 - arcSafe returns a richer result:
--    {safe, minGap, diveAt} where diveAt is nil for a
--    normal arc or 0.3/0.5/0.7 if a dive is needed.
--    getBestJumpDir propagates diveAt so the executor
--    knows when to fire the dive input.
--
--  All v27 scoring, viz, HUD unchanged.
